    title: { ko: '영국 Management of Health and Safety at Work Regulations 1999 (SI 1999/3242) — reg.3(위험성평가), reg.4(예방 원칙의 적용), Schedule 1(예방의 일반원칙)', en: 'UK Management of Health and Safety at Work Regulations 1999 (SI 1999/3242) — reg. 3 (risk assessment), reg. 4 (principles of prevention), Schedule 1 (general principles of prevention)' },
